      resignation IS A `Notice of resignation of a member of the tribunal` @desc The notice of resignation: the day it was given, whether it was in writing to the Minister, and the day it names as taking effect
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Role under Schedule 2` `Act of a member or the responsible officer under Schedule 2`
