@ref Schedule 2 paragraph 2(3) (src:834)
@export The Minister's duty to present to the States, not more than 2 weeks after terminating the appointment of a tribunal member, a notice that he or she has terminated it
GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Schedules 1 and 2` @desc The readings chosen for the counting of every period in Schedules 1 and 2 (the favoured reading of each fork is the default)
      `the day of the termination` IS A DATE @desc The day on which the Minister terminated the appointment
GIVETH A DEONTIC `Legal actor` `Act under Schedule 2`
`Sch 2 para 2(3) not more than 2 weeks after terminating the appointment the Minister must present to the States a notice that the Minister has terminated it` interp `the day of the termination` MEANS
    PARTY `the Minister`
    MUST `Sch 2: the Minister presents a notice of the termination of a member to the States`
    BEFORE (`Sch 1 and 2: the latest day for a notice of a termination` interp `the day of the termination` `Sch 2 para 2(3) the notice of the termination must be presented not more than this many weeks after terminating`)
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY `the Minister` BECAUSE "the Minister did not present to the States a notice that the appointment of a tribunal member was terminated not more than 2 weeks after terminating it"

@ref Schedule 2 paragraph 2(3) (src:834)
@export Whether the notice that the Minister has terminated the appointment of a member of the tribunal was presented to the States in time, that is not more than 2 weeks after the termination, counted as the chosen reading says
GIVEN interp IS AN `Interpretation of Schedules 1 and 2` @desc The readings chosen for the counting of every period in Schedules 1 and 2 (the favoured reading of each fork is the default)
      `the day of the termination` IS A DATE @desc The day on which the Minister terminated the appointment
      `the day on which the notice was presented to the States` IS A DATE @desc The day on which the Minister presented the notice of the termination to the States
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
