    `Sch 1 and 2: a notice of a termination was presented in time` interp `the day of the termination` `the day on which the notice was presented to the States` `Sch 2 para 2(3) the notice of the termination must be presented not more than this many weeks after terminating`

-- 2(4) is the chapeau of the three cases below, which are combined in the rule `Sch 2 para 2(4) the day on which the appointment expires`.
