        THEN CONSIDER `Sch 1 and 2: the last day for a step that is to be taken as soon as practicable` interp received
             WHEN NOTHING
                 THEN PARTY `the Minister`
                      MUST `Sch 2: the Minister lays a copy of the report on the tribunal before the States`
                      HENCE FULFILLED
                      LEST BREACH BY `the Minister` BECAUSE "the Minister did not lay a copy of the report before the States as soon as practicable after receiving it"
             WHEN JUST last
                 THEN PARTY `the Minister`
                      MUST `Sch 2: the Minister lays a copy of the report on the tribunal before the States`
                      BEFORE last
                      HENCE FULFILLED
                      LEST BREACH BY `the Minister` BECAUSE "the Minister did not lay a copy of the report before the States as soon as practicable after receiving it"

